<p>Each time you hit with an arrow you reduce the cooldown of one Blade Threading talent on cooldown by one turn.</p><p>Each time you hit with a melee weapon you reduce the cooldown of one Bow Threading talent on cooldown by one turn.</p><p>This effect can only occur <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> times per turn.</p>